    "created_at": "2016-01-28T00:06:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-28T00:06:36Z",
    "body": "I have no real feedback yet because we (my shop) have been waiting for the debate on how to do responsive images to produce something usable. But now that there is a spec and an implementation via Chrome 46 of client side hints the `picture` element now has our attention and we should be putting it into production in the 2nd or 3rd quarter of this year. So anything said before then would not be based on production experience.\n",
