    "created_at": "2016-07-05T20:43:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-05T20:43:51Z",
    "body": "The `template` case is made moot by https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1502 but there is still an issue of parentless `source` elements (whose node document _has_ a browsing context) is only allowed to have a `type` attribute and global attributes. But maybe that's OK. At least until there exist software that checks document conformance for such nodes... Closing this for now.\n",
